---
description: >-
  An event (ItemChanged) that references two separate prior commands
  (`->> 02 ->> 03`) rather than just one, verifying a frame can carry
  multiple source relations at once.
---
eventmodeling

tf 01 ui CartScreen
tf 02 cmd AddItem
tf 03 cmd RemoveItem
tf 04 evt ItemChanged ->> 02 ->> 03
